From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 05:53:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: spi: samsung: Add Exynos9820

The SPI masters in the USI blocks of the Exynos9820 have the register
layout and the 64 byte FIFO of the Exynos850 ones, so the new compatible
falls back to samsung,exynos850-spi, as the Exynos8895 one does.

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml
index 1ce8b2770a4..35f6474c6d1 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - samsung,exynos8895-spi
+              - samsung,exynos9820-spi
               - samsung,exynosautov920-spi
           - const: samsung,exynos850-spi
       - const: samsung,exynos7-spi
